        "original_id": "2d88c48e-546d-508a-8d1d-693e6734231b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Archie Andrews, John L. Goldwater, Bob Montana, Vic Bloom, Fiona Staples, Mike Costa\n- Companies: Archie Comics, WildStorm\n- Products: Archie, The Archie Show, Archie's Weird Mysteries, North 40, DV8: Gods and Monsters, T.H.U.N.D.E.R. Agents, Saga, Archie Andrews\n- Topics: Comic books, radio series, comic strips\n\nFacts:\n- Archie Andrews was created in 1941 by publisher John L. Goldwater and artist Bob Montana in collaboration with writer Vic Bloom.\n- Archie Andrews is the main character in an American comic book series published by Archie Comics.\n- Archie Andrews is also featured in the long-running \"Archie Andrews\" radio series, a syndicated comic strip, \"The Archie Show\", and \"Archie's Weird Mysteries\".\n- Archie is an ongoing comic book series featuring the Archie Comics character Archie Andrews.\n- Fiona Staples is a Canadian comic book artist known for work on \"North 40\", \"DV8: Gods and Monsters\", \"T.H.U.N.D.E.R. Agents\", \"Archie\", and \"Saga\".\n- Mike Costa's first published work was a 2008 project with artist Fiona Staples for WildStorm.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
